          "quote": "The XRD data obtained for both as cast and annealed samples of the Nb-19Si-5Mo-20Ti alloy (base alloy) are also presented for the purpose of comparison [Figure 1(a)]. The XRD pattern from the Nb-19Si-5Mo-20Ti-3Zr alloy exhibits distinct peaks of alpha, beta and gamma-(Nb, X)5(Si, Y)3 (where X and Y are substitutional solute atoms) and Nb ss.",
